<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "When someone is typing a message in a PM conversation, a subtle indicator appears showing \""
  )}<em>{dgettext("help_features", "NickName is typing...")}</em>".
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_general}>{dgettext("help_features", "Key Behaviors")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "- Only appears in private message conversations (not channels)")}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "- Disappears after 5 seconds of inactivity"
  )}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "- Disappears immediately when the other user sends their message"
  )}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "- Both users can see each other's typing indicators simultaneously"
  )}<br />{dgettext("help_features", "- Ignored users' typing indicators are not shown")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "When It Helps")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "In a private conversation, it tells you that an answer is on the way. You can wait for it instead of sending another message at the same time."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Where It Appears")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The line appears just above the chat input, in small italic text. You see it only while that PM is the conversation on screen. If you are looking at another channel or PM, it does not appear."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Your first key press in a PM tells the other person that you are typing."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "If you stop typing for about three seconds, the chat tells them that you stopped."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Sending the message also clears the indicator at once."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Text that starts with a slash is a command, so it does not count as typing."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules and Limits")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The indicator is never stored. Only the person in the PM can see it. There is no setting to turn it off."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-msg">{dgettext("help_features", "/msg Command")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-ignore-list">{dgettext("help_features", "Ignore List")}</.help_link>
</p>
